        "body": "<p>SA Art Fair is a working art ecosystem in Hout Bay. A studio where artists learn and make, and an online gallery where artists exhibit and sell, and a home for collectors who want to buy from the artists who create. Whichever door you come in through, creator, collector, artist or teacher; you’re part of our same creative circle.<\/p>",
